sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Usuario
  participant UI as UI (React / Konva)
  participant Store as Store (Zustand)
  participant Scheduler as Scheduler (Tiles)
  participant Worker as Web Worker (Comlink)
  participant QT as QuadTree (physics-core)
  participant RT as RayTracer (Direct / Fresnel)
  participant Canvas as Visor Canvas / WebGL

  User->>UI: Arrastra router en el plano
  UI->>Store: Actualiza posición router (inmutable)
  Store->>Scheduler: Notifica cambio de escena + generationId
  Scheduler->>Worker: Envia tiles (refinamiento progresivo: 1m -> 0.5m -> 0.25m)
  Worker->>QT: Consulta muros intersecados en segmento TX -> RX
  QT-->>Worker: Retorna lista deduplicada de muros
  Worker->>RT: Calcula pérdidas FSPL + Atenuación angular + Reflexiones
  RT-->>Worker: RSSI celda (dBm)
  Worker-->>Scheduler: Tile completado (Float32Array)
  Scheduler->>Canvas: Renderiza mapa de calor en viewport
